{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/581768-currently-writing-brainstorm","id":581768,"title":"currently writing brainstorm","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-06T18:29:51-07:00","id":581768,"title":"currently writing brainstorm","content":"lets say the G-M is looking for a tape cassette it knows that the tape is somewhere within a specific residential area most likely in some ones possession.<br /> <br /> how does the G-M search for it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T19:00:53-07:00","id":581805,"title":"","content":"<b>1</b> Dispatches instructions down through Command &amp; Control to the nearest suitably available project to the residential area.<br /> Let's say that's the post office, whose eccentric and byzantine sorting system implants suggestions in the postal employees there.<br /> <br /> <b>2</b> Project determines suitable means of initiating search for tape.<br /> Let's say that the hypnotic suggestions aren't elaborate enough to dispatch the postal employees as effective agents (sometimes human agents are enough!), but the postal office has also been using those employees to set up a ritual in preparation for the summoning of an angel of surveillance. The supervisor decides now is the time to complete the ritual, issues orders for the appropriate adjustments, and summons a Wheel.<br /> <br /> <b>3</b> Agents search for tape.<br /> The Wheel, under the identity of a housing inspector, makes his rounds within the area, using his angelic senses to put out a dragnet for the tape until it is located.<br /> <br /> <b>4</b> Unforeseen elements complicate the plan.<br /> Introduce the PCs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T19:09:26-07:00","id":581811,"title":"","content":"It dispatches a Psychopomp angel, the Neurosurgeon, to take up residence in the suburb. The strange events that went down at a recent housing auction provided both the occult matrix to summon the angel, and the rudimentary cover story for why it has access to a home in the area. By night, the Neurosurgeon visits the homes of known recluses, where it pries open their heads in order to expand their brain cavities. It uses various growth serums to promote their brains to expand in ways that foster the growth of telepathic powers, and programs them to scan the minds of passing residents until they locate the person who carries the tape and can alert the God-Machine to its location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T20:37:10-07:00","id":581905,"title":"","content":"The G-M needs to make a technological dead zone around a thirty story building, it only needs to last the length of a siege but it needs to stop all electronics.<br /> how?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T22:50:05-07:00","id":581974,"title":"","content":"Randy Mayer, working late at the local power distribution center gets a secure text message: SYLVAN GLARE LEAF MAP. When he comes to, he ignores the 44 seconds of lost time. He can't remember when he turned off his phone, but no new messages.<br /> <br /> A cult drives out to an empty field outside of the city at 4 am. Using miniature buildings, the cultists create an exact replica (1:400 scale) of the area to be affected: small houses, small trees, small business parks; even small power lines and creeks. Then they set up four lighting rods at the corners and tent the entire thing in wire mesh to create a Faraday cage.<br /> <br /> An angel strolls into the lobby, snaps his fingers, triggering a temporary shift in the local laws of physics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 07-07-2015, 02:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T23:12:12-07:00","id":581981,"title":"","content":"A hardware upgrade is placed onto each mobile phone communications tower around the desired site. When viewed on a map, it forms a perfect equilateral triangle. When the bell from the Town Hall starts chiming at 3 pm, an EMP spontaneously occurs, centred on the exact centre of the triangle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T23:19:17-07:00","id":581983,"title":"","content":"At 4:44am, an unmarked truck pulls up outside the building. The men inside, dressed in high visibility jackets, take industrial hoses from the back and connect them to the drainage system of the building. They then return to the truck and switch on the pump inside.<br /> <br /> Inside the pump are the anchors of ghosts who once lived in the building. They are rendered down to their spectral essence, which is pumped through the building. All technology ceases to work, and the toilets and taps begin to fill with a brackish red fluid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T22:13:30-07:00","id":592335,"title":"","content":"The G-M needs to kill 33 people. The location, the method and the characteristics of the victims do not matter. The only requirements are:<br /> <br /> 1. They have to die at the same time.<br /> 2. They cannot be killed in the same act (no plane crashes)<br /> 3. Their deaths cannot have any obvious link besides the time of death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-05T19:25:48-07:00","id":617031,"title":"","content":"Agentwestmer; sorry I hadn't checked this sooner love the question, bloody dark.<br /> over a small area have the G-M send subliminal messages through the radio or TV station it already controls. via a gifted recording left to a loyal employee. the message causes extremely violent impulses in exactly 33% of the listeners/watchers. the fact that the message will be heard by more then a hundred people is acceptable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-05T20:57:36-07:00","id":617121,"title":"","content":"I've been mulling over this for a while. Some pretty difficult conditions to work with. The best idea I had was the following:<br /> <br /> The God-Machine deploys the Broken Clock, an angel that only exists for a single second, twice a day. Local infrastructure embedded in the Town Hall's clock tower then activates to cause that single day to loop over and over, 33 times. The Broken Clock possesses its victims just long enough to perform the sacrifice, whether it be by having the victim commit suicide, murder a passer-by, trigger an &quot;accident&quot;, or even wield its own Numen to lethal effect. Each time the day reoccurs, those who died in previous versions of the day are already dead, although their bodies continue to run through the same motions they went through in the instance they died regardless of external stimuli. For the purposes of the universe, however, their time of death was in the second the Broken Clock killed them.<br /> <br /> However, as all the killings must occur at the same time, and since the Broken Clock is &quot;right twice a day&quot;, after every murder it has a single moment to itself. Its momentary appearances are the only thing mortals remember from day to day, and they lead to subtle changes in individuals' behaviour that cause greater and greater differences between the original version of the day and the thirty-third, made even more noticeable by the fact that the dead entirely fail to act upon any changes between the day of their death and the actual events of the current day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1059,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","user":"Azahul","date":". 08-05-2015, 11:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T19:31:47-07:00","id":636544,"title":"","content":"Okay I have a new scenario if anyone would like to chime in.<br /> <br /> the Cell is all headed to the Opera they have about 24 hours to prepare,I suspect they will spread out under separate covers some burners some their primary. they all know that the G-M is about to trigger an Occult Matrix here, so they're in a investigatory capacity.<br /> <br /> The G-M needs to kill 12 people without anyone knowing until the Opera finishes, I want one of the NPC Cell members to be a victim, and a performer. These 12 deaths will each match a location as if they were the numbers on a clock. with 12 being centre stage.<br /> <br /> should all go as planed (for the G-M) the Facility under the Opera house (that the PC don't know about) will have the added defence of being out of time with reality. as the 12 lives were cut short the time in the Facility will be vastly sped up allowing the G-M to Grow pseudo-organic angels faster. <br /> <br /> The question is two fold how does the G-M do this? whats needed? what does it look like? whats the linchpin?<br /> And how might a Cell of five (soon to be four) demons stop/hack it? saving that what might they do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T02:39:06-07:00","id":636824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>basketcase</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/581768-currently-writing-brainstorm?p=636544#post636544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The question is two fold how does the G-M do this? whats needed? what does it look like? whats the linchpin?<br /> And how might a Cell of five (soon to be four) demons stop/hack it? saving that what might they do?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is fun! Naturally there are multiple approaches. Subtle and intricate or simple and efficient. The God-Machine favours both, so pick what fits. <br /> <br /> One important thing you've not specified is whether or not they have to be murdered all at once, within a limited time frame or individually at specific times.If the deaths have to occur roughly at the same time it's far harder, though not impossible, to stop. If they're happening one at a time, appropriately what with the clock thing, it makes it easier to investigate.Currently you have it so that nobody can know anyone was killed - that means the PC investigation will easily unravel the Infrastructure just by finding a body. I'd change that so that the murders are kept secret to prevent he building being closed, evacuated, etc, or worst of all, the show being stopped! I have a glorious image of a director/manager being influenced/controlled by an angel and insisting the show must go on even as PCs try to shut it down.<br /> <br /> If you're favouring efficiency,the bodies were dispatched quickly and efficiently and hidden. The MO is likely the same for all of them (maybe one or two fought back but most were killed unawares) and that right there is your big fat clue. <br /> <br /> If you favour intricacy, each one died a different way. One of them everyone saw, an old woman who worked at the ticket office suffering a heart attack. She was rushed to hospital, but she'd died on the premise. It wasn't going to close the opera house - you know how money they'd lose? - but some of the staff are visibly upset (clue). Other deaths were probably hidden or disguised in various ways. One performer/stage hand simply never turned up (their body is hidden in a box/the rafters/etc). One of the victims was lured off the street, driven by hallucinations, and killed with nobody knowing they were even present. Their body is somewhere people don;t go - a cellar, an old storeroom, etc. A victim who died in the kitchen (a cook who went on holiday yesterday. but came back late at night because they forgot their wallet, which nobody knew about and nobody realises they're missing because, well, they've got the day off) has been butchered, their remains disguised as other meats and placed in the freezer.You get the idea. <br /> <br /> One approach is to have a murdering angel, or angels (though personally I'd have a one angel limit), do the dirty work. of course, The murderer could also be cultists, sleeper-agents or something weirder and more specific. The angel could take a human form, giving you a supernaturally empowered serial killer, or might be weirder. If you're going intricate, they work primarily through apparent chance - triggering heart attacks and accidents that grow ever more brazen as midnight and the final murder approach... and if you want efficiency,they just break necks with a quick and sickening twist. A cult doesn't have access to an angel's supernatural mojo, but they could pull of some carefully orchestrated murders (and some less so) easily enough. Sleeper agents are a great choice if all the murders need to happen roughly at once - some of the audience stand up and wander off to different locations when they hear a trigger phrase/a music sequence that was carefully inserted into the opera's score (which one or two of the musicians noticed, to give you a chance), their expressions curiously blank.Some of 'em aren't obvious patrons of the opera - one's in overalls, for example. <br /> <br /> Linchpins might be a specific murder weapon, the sleeper agents themselves, the specific timing/locations required, all of the above...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T05:21:06-07:00","id":636895,"title":"","content":"Aren't there psychopomp powers for acomplishing this sort of thing? Tracking down hidden objects?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T19:26:01-07:00","id":637638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>basketcase</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/581768-currently-writing-brainstorm?p=636544#post636544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The question is two fold how does the G-M do this? whats needed? what does it look like? whats the linchpin?<br /> And how might a Cell of five (soon to be four) demons stop/hack it? saving that what might they do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, <a href=\"http://www.forbes.com/sites/singularity/2012/12/06/yes-you-can-hack-a-pacemaker-and-other-medical-devices-too/\" target=\"_blank\">hacking the pacemakers</a> of the victims seems like the best way to avoid detection early on, though once that happens more than say... twice, people will start getting suspicious.<br /> <br /> You know what? This is Demon: the Descent? We do weird here.<br /> <br /> Try this: the lynchpin is a clock-maker who belonged to the outer circle of a G-M cult and was buried alive in the foundations back in 1872. The inner circle, in accordance with instruction from a Messenger or through interpretation of occult texts, picks this poor guy (perhaps he betrayed the cult in some fashion) and inters him the night before construction of the opera house begins, and since the cult was funding the construction, they were in place to put bribes to look the other way, and to watch over the Opera house for nearly a century and a half. The G-M has planned this for a very long time; play up the horror when the characters realize just how far sighted the G-M's plans actually are.<br /> <br /> Every time one of the murders is committed, the Opera house is regress back in time 12 years, first to 2003, then to 1991, 1979 and so forth all the way to 1871. Any demon will be mentally unaffected, and there are no immediate physical effects ( a person who is 30 in 2015 will still be 30 in 2003, 1991, etc) but any normal mortal in the opera house will think that he has a perfectly normal life in the new era, all of their memories are edited to push them 12 years forwards. Physical artifacts such as cell phones, clothes, newpapers and concessions in the lobby will be replaced with period appropriate items. Family members and companions of the victims will think it odd that their friends are missing the opera, but since they've been bounced back, they don't remember that the missing people were (will be? are?) murdered.<br /> <br /> Attendees will natural focus their attention on the opera, but if forced to realize the inconsistencies in their new life, they might have some sort of a break down or realization (<i>How old are you?</i> 37. <i>When were you in the military?</i> When I was 18.<i> Do you see any action?</i> Yeah, I fought in Afghanistan. <i>It's 2003 right now, Afghanistan, why are you here, 30 years old, and not in the military?</i> Ummm...) Additionally, the Inspiration Embed has the unique situational effect of making a human target realize what's going on, and accepting it with much more calm (they get the Informed condition).<br /> <br /> For the actual party carrying out these murders, I like the idea that our original cult goes to the opera house every 12 years, switches over to the going-in-reverse timeline and murders the selected individual... so if the players run into the cult in 2003, the cult will already have fought them 11 times, with each team of cultist assassins having the notes, received experience and training from the cultists that went before. In some cases, a veteran cultist might run into the players 2 to 3 times. The Ring will also have to deal with the ghost of the murdered clock-maker, who be comes more and more active, more powerful, and less sane as the Opera house goes back in time and is saturated with G-M essence and aether.<br /> <br /> The G-m Gradually sheds the human patrons into different time periods, using other Infrastructure maintained by the cult to integrate them into new lives that closely resemble their previous (future?) lives. To an extent. Pity the interracial couple now living in 1907.<br /> <br /> The G-m's win condition is to regress the Opera house to 1871, one year past the year of construction. The resulting paradox conceals the opera house deep within the folds of time and space.<br /> <br /> To stop this and to destroy or subvert the infrastructure, will need to deal with the clock maker's ghost, and remove his corpse to a proper burial. IF then they have the ability to travel to any of the 12 periods (2015, 2003, 1991,1979,1967, 1955, 1943, 1931, 1919, 1907,1895, and 1883)... as long as they're willing to ritually murder someone at a certain time of day during an opera's performance to activate it. Should be a good way to get some use out of Dark Eras.<br /> <br /> As a final addendum, when the players are researching the opera house, they find that the same opera has be played every 12 years, to the day, all the way back to 1883. Problem is, the opera in question was written in 1891.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 08-24-2015, 01:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T22:35:32-07:00","id":637727,"title":"","content":"The killer is the opera itself, a magical spell woven by the performers. They aren't even aware that what they're doing has any magical properties, the opera was suggested by a member of the troupe (no one can remember exactly who, the Angel responsible has been scrubbed from their minds) and they all decided it was the best choice.<br /> <br /> At regular intervals throughout the show, the organ is keyed to produce a siren-like electrical trilling, audible only to the sacrifice. Each sacrifice is chosen by the organ based on their seat number (not quite as simple as 1A, 2B, 3C, etc, but an algorithm that makes it obvious that they are being picked at points on a circle). It compels them to descend into the bowls of the building, not noticing that they are walking right into the bloody gears of the God-Machine. Even a Demon is not immune to its influence. The disappearance of these people will hopefully go unnoticed until the performance ends.<br /> <br /> At the climax of the performance, one of the lead performers will collapse on stage as the final sacrifice. The bombardment by electronic signals will cause them to bleed from the nose and mouth, and the blood will drip through the floor to join the bodies of the others down below.<br /> <br /> In terms of lynchpin, the organ's subterranean extensions are the most obvious. The crew had to modify it to create the kind of sounds they needed for their performance, and these modifications are clearly God-Machine infrastructure to anyone who looks at them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/581768-currently-writing-brainstorm?p=636895#post636895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aren't there psychopomp powers for acomplishing this sort of thing? Tracking down hidden objects?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure? I'm genuinely not sure what your point is. The God-Machine moves in mysterious ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T18:06:19-07:00","id":647466,"title":"","content":"Change of pace:<br /> <br /> 4:17 Friday at your corner office on the fourth floor of the Deva Corporation's Seattle campus, putting the finishing touches for the report on last month's operation into the G-m's Apocalypse Vault infrastructure (let's not mince words, the was f*#$ing weird.) When Gary Stevenson bursts into your office with a million-dollar smile.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey! 'Atta girl on last month.&quot; Gary runs his office like he coaches his grandson's little league team. It would be annoying if he wasn't so generous with raises and performance reviews. &quot;Really great stuff, feather in your cap stuff there. Anyway, before you run out, I want you to take a look at something, get some ideas percolating over the weekend.&quot; He pats you on the back and put a thick folder on your desk,it reads EYES ONLY - PAPER ONLY. &quot;The higher ups want to open a branch location in the Greater London area, really something of an oversight that we haven't opened a branch earlier, but we're getting that fixed now.&quot; Gary turns serious. &quot;We want you to draw up security protocols and infiltration countermeasures. The market intelligence division is pretty sure that there's significant rogue halo activity in the city, with <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/195048-agencies\">at least one Agency</a> buried deeply into the UK security apparatus. If these guys slip an infiltrator in... well, that's your job, make sure that doesn't happen, countermeasures and damage control if it does.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What's the budget?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Five billion.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;How much of that is allocated to the security budget?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;That <i>is</i> the security budget. We can't afford to not do this properly, and we're dealing with an ENE type that can shuffle reality like playing cards when it's not wearing the skin of someone you've known you're entire life. Let me know what you can come up with, I need a proposal on my desk at close of business, two weeks from now.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>So, how does a <u>mostly</u> human megacorporation deal with demonic infiltrators?</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T12:45:16-07:00","id":648267,"title":"","content":"Agentwestmer; 5 Billion is way overkill, but it opens us up to some crazy options.<br /> <br /> First step would be to clear or kill the in house security force. do this with an angel take some of that money to secure a cult and summon or create that angel off site and off the books.<br /> The next step would be to flag and survey all employees. order high tech surveillance gadgets based on Living Recorder and Catch and Release. to track and record their movements, watch for clandestine meetings, unusual patterns or the breaking of usual patterns. <br /> Setup interviews/interrogations disguised as performance reviews. Top off the reviews with loyalty tests. perhaps the killing of a captured stigmatic or demon. with the option to have them resurrected to be killed again. Have the test subjects mind wiped and then be forced to repeat the test multiple times should the results be in question. <br /> Leek misinformation and watch to see who responds.<br /> Create falseflag hostage situation where in you've &quot;found&quot; an enemy agent don't publicize who only where, and wait for their rescuer.<br /> And remember no one is above scrutiny, even once cleared.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T17:24:17-07:00","id":648475,"title":"","content":"I'm a bit unsure. Are we trying to establish a sense of security using purely mundane (or mostly mundane) assets? Or are we investing in Infrastructure construction, shipping in angel components, acquiring Cryptics, or similarly supernatural defences?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T18:38:00-07:00","id":648500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>basketcase</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/581768-currently-writing-brainstorm?p=648267#post648267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agentwestmer; 5 Billion is way overkill, but it opens us up to some crazy options.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given that they're a cult turned Megacorporation dealing with reality-bending infiltrators, the options are go big, or go home.<br /> Apple's 2014 revenue was north of 180 billion dollars, and no one working at the Geek Bar has to worry about a fallen-robot-angel trying to buy their soul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}